# Run r1102b slice 1, Boot A: group A superflat world s1a that Boot O (s1_O.qb) built with the three pre-nest jars;
# those jars are out now (current mods/ only: CD nests Vintage, CB nests Vinery and Brewin'). Setup: s1_setup.md, Boot A.
# Probes copied into srv/kubejs/server_scripts before the boot: zz_zq_probe.js (prep_srv.sh), zz_vtd_probe.js
# (tools/vintage_probe/vintage_probe.js), zz_kt_probe.js (tools/kitchen_probe/cfb_kitchen_probe.js), zz_count.js
# (tools/fungi_probe/zcount.js), zz_trades.js (tools/fungi_probe/ztrades.js), zz_zloot_probe.js and zz_zti_probe.js
# (tools/scratch_query/).
# Home: the marker tagged s1home (capture H; y = H2, the air layer over the superflat grass). Lanes, offsets from H:
#   Boot O blocks x -30..-20, z 0..5; starter-kit bots x 0, z -5; PS-03 x 2, z -10; VTD6-01 x 10..21, z -20;
#   VTD6-02 x 10..14, z -25; LE-03 dispensers x 30, z -10 / -22 / -34; FDB-03 x 40..46, z -10 / -14; FDB-04 x 50, z -10;
#   FDB-05 x 54..62, z -10; FDB-06 x 54..57, z -16; FDB-07 x 70..82, z -10..-26; FDB-11 x 44..50, z -30;
#   FDB-13 / -14 x 40..72, z -40 / -50 (stone ceiling at H2+3); CDJ-07 sapling x 90, z -10; VP-16 template x 60..90, z 20..45.
#   /vtdtest builds at absolute x 200..300, z 20..40, y -60; /kttest at absolute x 0..12, y -58.
# Order: Boot O read-back first, boot-log rows, data rows, probes, world rows, then the rows that edit a config
# (FDB-05, FDB-07, TI-01) and last the /reload (VP-05b). No kjsexpect rows, so the /reload order is free.
# Bots get a starter kit 10 ticks after their first join (creativecompat starter_kit.js): every row that needs a
# bot's hand or inventory waits 2 s and clears the bot first. One bot name per row.
pace 2

## SQ-VTD4-05 | 1.1.02 Pickling Jar (9 slots) loads in the nested Vintage with its 9 items and a 10th slot
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (?i)mixin apply failed.*(vintagedelight|vinery|brewinandchewin|farmersdelight)
shell ls mods | grep -i backported; true
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s1home,limit=1] Pos
capture H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> forceload add {H1-32} {H3-56} {H1+96} {H3+48}
> forceload add 192 16 304 48
sleep 5
> difficulty easy
> weather clear 100000
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set 2000
> data get block {H1-28} {H2} {H3}
expect has the following block data: .*Size: 10
expect has the following block data: .*Count: 9b
reject (?i)fermenting.?jar.*(error|exception)
look the jar's Items list still has the 9 stick stacks (counts 1..9) in slots 0..8 and Size 10; no error naming the jar in latest.log

